'''Three Faces in the Dark''' is a [[divination card]]. A set of seven can be exchanged for a stack of three {{il|Chaos Orb|Chaos Orbs}}.

{{Item acquisition}}

==Design attribution==
Three Faces in the Dark was created by supporter [https://www.pathofexile.com/account/view-profile/Noshei-0307 Noshei].<ref name="Supporter attribution" /> Noshei also created {{il|Beauty Through Death}} and {{il|Lucky Deck}}.{{Citation needed}}

